      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Val_Verde%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1939, the community celebrated the laying of the cornerstone for its Olympic‑era swimming pool, a ceremony attended by actress Hattie McDaniel.",
